{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-11T10:11:26.385Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-HOSTED-PAYRUN-LIVE-01","attempt":1,"title":"A pay run with payee-signed invoices and an employer-authorised auditor pack on the real hardware room, settled on the production contract","tier":"hardware","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. A mismatched invoice stops the run; a corrected run settles with exact amounts; receipts carry their invoice hash and verify against the on-chain order hash; the auditor sees only the line the employer opens; the stateless checks answer on the VM.","limits":["One operator controls every account and the VM. This is the system working on real hardware, not independent parties.","Every payment's address and amount is public on NEAR once settled: this hides who a payee is, not how much.","The coordinator holds the key that triggers a run. Only NEAR payments are made from the hardware room here; foreign-chain payments go through the contract and have their own experiment.","The VM exists for the length of the session and is deleted; no hosted room is running."],"requires":["phala-key","near-key","network","docker"],"chain_prev":"ca1da1d0a9359ba6aff3df6a709ac000ef1149980fa1fd843fa5b46e0ba1c55a","chain_hash":"ba838d78d8d782f4f4e097183a226b66ddd8dc491ef325e015f993af936e7c37"}
